</span>
</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib12" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem"><span id="bib.bib12.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Chowdhery et al. (2022)</span></span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib12.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
Aakanksha Chowdhery, Sharan Narang, Jacob Devlin, Maarten Bosma, Gaurav Mishra, Adam Roberts, Paul Barham, Hyung Won Chung, Charles Sutton, Sebastian Gehrmann, et al.
